"""webapp-gui — turn websites into desktop apps (.desktop launchers).

Usage:
  webapp-gui                              open the graphical interface
  webapp-gui list                         list the web apps
  webapp-gui add NAME URL [-b BROWSER] [-i ICON] [-f]
  webapp-gui remove NAME

Each web app is stored in ~/.local/share/applications/webapp-<slug>.desktop
and can be launched with:  gtk-launch webapp-<slug>

The interface follows the system language (English and Spanish for now).
"""
